post_install() {
  cat <<'EOM'
==> dwarfstar4 ROCm runtime notes
  • /dev/kfd access requires your user in BOTH render and video groups:
      sudo usermod -aG render,video "$USER"
    then log out/in (or reboot).

  • Verify ROCm sees your GPU and your groups are active:
      rocminfo | grep -m1 gfx
      groups | grep -E 'render|video'

  • If your APU/GPU needs an override, try:
      HSA_OVERRIDE_GFX_VERSION=11.0.0 ds4 -m ~/.local/share/models/ds4flash.gguf

  • On systems with both iGPU and dGPU, pick a device at runtime with:
      HIP_VISIBLE_DEVICES=0 ds4 ...
      ROCR_VISIBLE_DEVICES=1 ds4 ...

  • Models are expected in ~/.local/share/models (or $XDG_DATA_HOME/models).
    Download the recommended Strix Halo Flash model with:
      dwarfstar4-download-model q2-imatrix
    The downloader skips files already present.
EOM
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}
